{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c8d01b53c01d0c2ba18b868352f15ee275a428221541731517f24505bde1118d", "ja": "（今日は一日、みんなで川遊びを楽しんだ！\nみんな、すごくはしゃいでいたな）", "zh": "（今天一整天，大家都尽情享受了玩水的乐趣！大家都玩得特别开心）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "8f77bd247e098de1be5ea66a7e135f7132e1476381156119ebe0a33630a30fed", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしました！\n他のみんなもすぐに来ると思います。", "zh": "{$P$}，让您久等了！\n其他人应该也马上就会来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7b0e6d9ab6e9d64e01ee2cd985b077ed4d406cb56779ef319b170dc17fdd9183", "ja": "お、そうか。お疲れさま。\n今日はどうだった？", "zh": "哦，是吗。辛苦了。\n今天怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "54d376dc3f86ad7aee4b54afc47b774b40f4b8edd7511b53c473fc3b17961b43", "ja": "はい、楽しかったです！　スイカもおいしくて……♪\n連れてきてくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "是的，玩得很开心！西瓜也很好吃……♪\n谢谢您带我来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1004_p", "source_sha256": "92df41cd20f0742d40e3adff78f95375352df5f98f5cdd78ada90b5a5fee4813", "ja": "それならよかった。そういえば\n水着、よく似合っていたぞ。健康的な感じで。", "zh": "那就好。对了，\n你穿泳衣的样子很合适。看起来很健康。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "8fabce5e4cf1e3437f8029f351ad3cad8dacb845f21ac5b3188c4402a1a45e0c", "ja": "えっ、あ……ありがとうございますっ。\nええと、でも、あの……。", "zh": "诶，啊……谢谢您。\n那个，不过……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "c4892ce12496279d72f5610197387db902921200a15949c0259629f847611d2d", "ja": "実はさっき、みんなが撮った画像を見たんですけど、\nその……私、結構無防備だったみたいで……うぅ。", "zh": "其实刚才我看了大家拍的照片，\n那个……我好像相当毫无防备的样子……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6a12ef61bd7f5bf5cffaf317b67f0a5c36bdccc3c37601de72d89ac6fd463e98", "ja": "そうなのか？　楽しそうなところしか覚えてないけど。\n……後で見せてもらおうかな？", "zh": "是这样吗？我只记得看起来都挺开心的。\n……之后能让我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "1eb2997ae4b030ad329ebb7539105d5eb9d2e0e6dfe0c16928404303b143d129", "ja": "だ、ダメ！　あんな大胆な……！\n{$P$}には絶対見せられません～！", "zh": "不、不行！那么大胆的……！\n绝对不能给{$P$}看～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0222_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c6c0ae0f43395a0e0a2161f5dc387ae3819ceb6ad1a9e738c38d7f4f3f902a3a", "ja": "（そう言いながら、紗代子はどこか楽しそうだ。\nリフレッシュになったなら、何よりだな）", "zh": "（紗代子嘴上这么说着，却显得有些开心。能让她放松一下，那就再好不过了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
